        "source_solution": "a (x-40)(0.1x-6); b (y-8)(y/16+1/8); c (x-10)(0.3x+5.5). Multiplying gives respectively 0.1x^2-10x+240, y^2/16-3y/8-1, 0.3x^2+2.5x-55.",
        "unit_reason": "比较完整三式结果，检验根和首项系数的共同保持。",
        "concept_blocks": [
          0,
