      "view": {
        "mode": "multiple",
        "stem": "约分并保留原分母不为零的限制。选择所有正确结果。\n\n$a)\\frac{7x^2+x-8}{7x-7}$；$b)\\frac{5a+10}{2a^2+13a+18}$；$c)\\frac{b^2-8b+15}{b^2-25}$；$d)\\frac{y^2-5y-36}{81-y^2}$；$e)\\frac{c^2-c-110}{22+9c-c^2}$；$f)\\frac{5a^2+8a+3}{14+3a-11a^2}$。",
        "figure_ids": [],
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "$a)=\\frac{7x+8}{7}$，$x\\ne1$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "B",
            "text": "$b)=\\frac5{2a+9}$，$a\\ne-2,-\\frac92$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "C",
            "text": "$c)=\\frac{b-3}{b+5}$，只需 $b\\ne-5$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
            "id": "D",
            "text": "$d)=-\\frac{y+4}{y+9}$，$y\\ne9,-9$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          },
          {
