            "text": "$f)=\\frac{5a+3}{14-11a}$，$a\\ne-1,\\frac{14}{11}$。",
            "figure_ids": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "intent": {
        "task": "用二次式因式分解约分，同时保持消去因式的零点孔洞。",
        "source_solution": "a (7x+8)/7, x!=1; b 5/(2a+9), a!=-2,-9/2; c (b-3)/(b+5), b!=5,-5; d -(y+4)/(y+9), y!=9,-9; e -(c+10)/(c+2), c!=11,-2; f (5a+3)/(14-11a), a!=-1,14/11. Factor numerator and denominator first; the canceled denominator zero remains excluded.",
        "unit_reason": "每项含一个完整化简式和原定义域，避免只选一个计算格。",
        "concept_blocks": [
          0
        ],
        "limitations": [
          "独立写出六式的因式分解、约分和原分母零点排除过程未测；自主补正错误商或定义域未测。"
        ],
        "figure_observations": []
      },
      "key": {
        "correct": [
